# Native low-degree sheaf cohomology of an actual cochain resolution

`LowExt.CochainResolution.h1Iso` and `h2Iso` identify the genuine Ext
groups with the native homology of the complex of global sections.
The hypotheses are exactness of the actual augmented complex and
the specific low-degree cohomology vanishing of its first two terms.
Both comparisons commute with genuine augmented cochain maps.
-/
